# Optional. The app runs fully without any of these — templates are used
# for the reasons text and the service starts and scores orders normally.
#
# Only set both of the following to turn on LLM rephrasing of the 3 reason
# sentences (score and reason selection are unaffected either way):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# USE_LLM=1
# LLM_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
